\ Division overflow: most-negative-cell / -1 used to raise SIGFPE and kill
\ the process. Now it errors cleanly, which halts this eval — so only the
\ sentinel prints.
\
\ The most-negative cell is computed portably (independent of cell width):
\ -1 is all-bits-set; a logical right shift by 1 gives the largest positive
\ value, and adding 1 wraps to the most-negative one.
42 .
-1 -1 shift 1 +   -1 /
99 .
